 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Deny + -ing / that-clause",
     "texto": [
      "**Deny + -ing** y **deny + that-clause** sirven para negar que alguien haya hecho algo: **The manager denied changing the figures**; **The manager denied that she had changed them**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Deny + nombre",
     "texto": [
      "**Deny a request** = rechazar una solicitud. **Deny someone access to a file** = no permitir que alguien acceda a un archivo; no significa afirmar que esa persona no lo haya recibido."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Admit",
     "texto": [
      "**Admit + -ing** y **admit + that-clause** expresan que se reconoce como cierto algo: **She admitted receiving the report**. En ese sentido, **admit** expresa lo contrario de **deny**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "etapa": "leer",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Una auditoría",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "A discrepancy appeared in the sales report.",
       "alumno": "Apareció una discrepancia en el informe de ventas.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "discrepancy",
         "discrepancia"
        ],
        [
         "sales report",
         "informe de ventas"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The manager denied changing the figures but admitted receiving the original report.",
       "alumno": "La gerente negó haber cambiado las cifras, pero admitió haber recibido el informe original.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "denied changing",
         "negó haber cambiado"
        ],
        [
         "admitted receiving",
         "admitió haber recibido"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "When auditors asked to check the source file, she denied them access until the review was complete.",
       "alumno": "Cuando los auditores pidieron revisar el archivo original, ella les denegó el acceso hasta que terminara la revisión.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "denied them access",
         "les denegó el acceso"
        ],
        [
         "until the review was complete",
         "hasta que terminara la revisión"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "The auditors later confirmed that one figure was wrong, but they could not identify who had changed it.",
       "alumno": "Más tarde, los auditores confirmaron que una cifra era incorrecta, pero no pudieron identificar quién la había cambiado.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [
        [
         "confirmed that",
         "confirmaron que"
        ],
        [
         "could not identify who had changed it",
         "no pudieron identificar quién la había cambiado"
        ]
       ],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
